    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕdĭon</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of Acarnania</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 36,
